				<div class="calibration-note" id="calibration-note" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span class="note-icon">i</span><span>For the most accurate measurements, compare the ruler against a standard card or physical ruler. Browser display data can only provide an estimate.</span><button id="dismiss-note" type="button" aria-label="Dismiss calibration note">×</button></div>
