			<section class="how-section" id="how-it-works">
				<div class="eyebrow">MEASURE WITH CONFIDENCE</div>
				<div class="how-grid"><h2>Simple by design.<br />Accurate by calibration.</h2><div class="how-copy"><p>Every display is different. A quick calibration aligns the ruler on your screen with the real world, so you can measure small objects without reaching for a physical ruler.</p><a href="#calibration">Choose a calibration method <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
